 *
 * Description: 
 *  Experiments to measure scaling performance of cuts over different size
 * of files from 1 to 41 bkgs files. 
 * For simple (ranksort) optimization on default AMOS cost model (i.e. without
 * cost model for aggregates and udfs.
 * Cut query based on 2005 in best order, which is the paper order.
 * Run this script in ALEH started by run.current.limited.2005.sh.
 ****************************************************************************
 * $Log: ScalingBkgs.2005.MAN.osql,v $
 * Revision 1.1  2008/01/29 20:34:53  ruslan
 * scaling experiment for MAN 2005
 *
 ****************************************************************************/

cd('osql');
<'../experiments/stream.osql';

openwritefile('../experiments/ScalingBkgs.2005.MAN.txt');
manscaling(5);
closewritefile();
